{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1759675035\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1759675035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stone of Advenutre we take a classic roguelike deckbuilder (like Slay the Spire), featuring animated card battles, and blend it with tactical, procedurally generated hexagonal maps where you can interact with obstacles. The result is a dynamic fusion that generates tens of thousands of unique combat scenarios!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Usable obstacles!</strong> - Break bridges to trap enemies, hurl stones for ranged attacks, or snack on berries for instant buffs during battle\u2014and that's just the start of over 50 interactive elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.poster.avif?t=1759675035\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.webm?t=1759675035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.mp4?t=1759675035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Generation:</strong> Maps feature varied height differences, randomized obstacle placements, and enemy positions, leading to diverse battle types like ambushes, escorts, and escapes. This creates an endlessly replayable experience with fresh challenges every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.poster.avif?t=1759675035\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.webm?t=1759675035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.mp4?t=1759675035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Amazing Worlds:</strong> Venture through four distinct biomes, each with its own themes and secrets! Collect rare cards, powerful artifacts, and recruit unexpected allies while completing quests\u2014from straightforward errands to epic boss trials. Every expedition delivers new strategies and memorable moments!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442270?t=1759675035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759675035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/023cf044da319783baaca6cdcd98cc7a0a3a42ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759675035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/023cf044da319783baaca6cdcd98cc7a0a3a42ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759675035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb